{"answer": "Lore's nightly full re-index CronJob (`context_reindex`) was retired on 2026-09-08. That is the date of the amendment to ADR-019 that records it. The job had failed on every run for at least four nights without anyone noticing. Ingestion had already become merge-time only, run by the `ci-ingest` hook. The ADR deleted the job, its `cronJobs` entry, and the `reindex` module.", "sources": ["adrs/ADR-019-scheduled-job-runtime-split.md"]}
```

